## Troubleshooting

| Issue                          | Solution                                  |
|---------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| `error: no such file or directory` | Check paths in `export` commands          |
| `undefined reference`           | Ensure `LDFLAGS` include `-lmkl`          |
| `MPI not found`                 | Verify `MPICC` points to correct MPI      |
| `OpenMP not working`            | Add `-qopenmp` to all `CFLAGS`/`FCFLAGS` |


> ✅ **Pro Tip**: For optimal performance, always use `-xCORE-AVX512` flags with Intel compilers.

